  "oracle_method": "Mirror Point.dominates, the size-1/2 base cases, floor(size/2) recursive split, left-side duplicate-x removal, early-stop minimum-y scan, right-side y filtering, and source-order concatenation; serialize signed i32 point pairs little-endian.",
